explanation=`flatMap` becomes `concatMap`, or the other way round, which changes the order inner streams' items come in, and whether they run at once. It goes unnoticed when no test has inner streams that overlap.
id=reactive/swap-order
methods=[concatMap, flatMap]
owners=[io.reactivex.rxjava3.core.Flowable, io.reactivex.rxjava3.core.Observable, reactor.core.publisher.Flux]
rewrite=rename flatMap->concatMap, concatMap->flatMap
since=0
source=
templates={headline=no test tells `{name}` from `{to}` in {method}, help=add a test whose inner streams overlap in time, and assert the order the items come in}
